  "steps": [
    {
      "text": "• Preheat oven to 240°C/220°C fan-forced.  Cut zucchini into bite-sized chunks. Tear kale leaves from stem, then roughly chop leaves.\n• Place pumpkin and zucchini on the lined oven tray. Drizzle with olive oil and season with salt.\n• Toss to coat and roast until tender, 10-15 mins. Remove the tray from the oven and add the kale, tossing with the veggies. Return to the oven and cook for a further 5-10 minutes.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61bab004af9c120767592694/step-3964640b.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Meanwhile, finely chop or crush garlic.\n• In a large saucepan, heat a drizzle of olive oil  over medium-high heat.\n• Cook garlic and tomato paste until fragrant, 1 min.\n• Add the water, vegetable stock, garlic seasoning and risoni. Bring to boil.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61bab004af9c120767592694/step-caecab9b.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Reduce heat to medium and cook, stirring, until ‘al dente’, 10-12 mins.\n• Stir the roasted veggies and butter through the risoni.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61bab004af9c120767592694/step-082967da.jpg"
    },
    {
      "text": "• Divide veggie risoni between bowls.\n• Top with almonds and crumbled fetta.",
      "imageUrl": "https://img.hellofresh.com/f_auto,fl_lossy,q_auto,w_800/hellofresh_s3/61bab004af9c120767592694/step-8f093d9d.jpg"
    }
  ]
